# devices/surya/drivers/wifi/conf: the POCO X3 NFC's own Wi-Fi driver (the format of drivers/wifi/conf, docs/drivers-config.md).

driver WCN3990
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.wcn3990.c
	default n
	requires MODEM ADSP
	help    the Wi-Fi of the POCO X3 NFC, a WCN3990 whose firmware runs on the modem: step one, the exchange with that
	help    firmware's service (WLFW) as ath10k's qmi.c makes it (wcn3990=1, with the modem up). No other phone builds it
